	<div class="pkp_block block_announcements">
		<h2 class="title">Announcements</h2>
		<div class="content">
							<article class="block_announcements_article">
					<h3 class="block_announcements_article_headline">
						<a href="https://jcmm.co.in/index.php/jcmm/announcement/view/19">
							J. Comput. Mech. Manag. Now Accepts Submissions in PDF Format Only
						</a>
					</h3>
					<time class="block_announcements_article_date" datetime="2026-05-25">
						<strong>25 May 2026</strong>
					</time>
					<div class="block_announcements_article_content">
																			<p>Effective immediately, all manuscript submissions to the Journal of Computers, Mechanical and Management (J. Comput. Mech. Manag.) must be uploaded in PDF format only.</p>
											</div>
				</article>
							<article class="block_announcements_article">
					<h3 class="block_announcements_article_headline">
						<a href="https://jcmm.co.in/index.php/jcmm/announcement/view/18">
							Article Processing Charges from 1 October 2026
						</a>
					</h3>
					<time class="block_announcements_article_date" datetime="2026-04-25">
						<strong>25 April 2026</strong>
					</time>
					<div class="block_announcements_article_content">
																			<p>The journal's Article Processing Charge will move from USD 250 to USD 1,000 for manuscripts submitted from 1 October 2026 onwards. Submissions received on or before 30 September 2026 (23:59 UTC) will continue to be processed at USD 250. A tiered waiver scheme based on the World Bank country classification applies from 1 October 2026.</p>
											</div>
				</article>
					</div>
	</div>
